OL,3,GNEWSAMarket in 'difficult position'
OL,4,Aaccording to review
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincoln's Cornhill Market is in a
OL,7,F"difficult position", according to a
OL,8,Freview commissioned by the city's
OL,9,Fcouncil, but experts said it was not in
OL,10,Fcrisis.
OL,12,FMarket specialists Next Phase carried
OL,13,Fout the review of the venue, which
OL,14,Freopened after an #8m refurbishment in
OL,15,F2024 but which has run at a loss ever
OL,16,Fsince.
OL,18,FThe company's report said the market
OL,19,Fcould succeed with a new commercial
OL,20,Fmodel, but added there was a need to
OL,21,Freview everything from the layout to
OL,22,Fmanagement and marketing.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
