OL,3,GNEWSAMarket in 'difficult position'
OL,4,Aaccording to review
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoshua Wells, City of Lincoln Council's
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for economic growth,
OL,8,Fsaid experts were confident there was a
OL,9,Fway forward.
